[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！\u3000そっちも無事に上陸できたのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! I'm glad you made it ashore safely too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お疲れ、ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good work, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "両名とも船長としての働き、見事だったよ。\nこの航海が成功したのは君たちのおかげだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You both performed admirably as captains. This voyage's success is thanks to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ。\nこちらこそ、任せていただきありがとうございました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You honor us. Thank you for trusting us with this responsibility."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無事に全員連れてこられてホッとしたぜ。\nだが、何も俺たちだけの手柄ってわけじゃねえだろ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a relief to get everyone here in one piece. Though we can't take all the credit, can we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。特に、トトリには助けられたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. Totori was especially helpful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ？\u3000えへへ……ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? Hehe... Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今後も、無数島群域を周るために船を出す必要がある。\n引き続きよろしく頼むよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll need the boats to get around in this region. I trust we can continue to count on you both?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "了解しました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おう、任せとけ！\u3000どこまでも行ってやるぜ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to us! We'll get you where you need to be!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お待たせ。こちら側の準備が整った。\n入国審査があるから、役場まで来て",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry for the wait. Everything's ready on our end. Next is immigration - please follow me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "承知した。案内を頼む",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood. Lead the way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神聖国の基礎知識は道中教えたけど、実は\n入国審査では、漫談をして審査官を笑わせる必要がある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I may have taught you the basics about our culture during our journey, but I forgot to mention that visitors need to make the immigration officer laugh to be granted entry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "冗談。緊張を解きほぐそうかと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just kidding. Thought I'd help ease the tension."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……余計に緊張してしまうではないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Great, now I'm even more on edge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海が近いわりに、カラッとしてて涼しいわね。\n風が気持ちいい～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Despite being near the ocean, it's so refreshing and cool here. The breeze feels wonderful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナの王都ほど賑わってはいないけど、\n綺麗でいい街だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's not as busy as Lantarna's capital, but it's such a beautiful city."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんか独特な匂いの花がいっぱい咲いてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And there are so many flowers with unique fragrances blooming everywhere."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの向こうのほうに見えるの、遺跡か何かかしら？\nこんな街の近くにあるのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are those ruins I see in the distance? Right next to the city too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ランターナにある遺跡と\n雰囲気が似てる気がしますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...They do seem similar to the ruins back in Lantarna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つまりパルメ族と関係があると？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps they might be connected to the Palme?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その可能性はあると思います。\n……後でじっくり調べてみないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's possible. ...We should investigate them thoroughly later."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手続きはここでお願い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please complete your paperwork here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、案内ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, thank you for your guidance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神官長様だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's the High Priest!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんにちは！\u3000神官長様！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good day, Your Holiness!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんの騒ぎ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's all the commotion about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップちゃん、お疲れさま。\nこちらが、大陸からのお客さま？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good work, Bepp. Are these our guests from the continent?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この方はノーヴァ神聖国の神官長よ。\nあと、こちらは私の上司のヤンネさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is Nova's High Priest. And this is Janne, my superior."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神官長……というと、この国の最高権力者じゃないか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The High Priest... the highest authority in this nation!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ王国第二王子のリヒャルトと申します。\nご足労いただきありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Richard, Second Prince of Lantarna. Thank you for taking the time to meet us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえいえ。\nこちらこそ、はるばるお越しいただき感謝しております",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, no. We are grateful that you've come such a long way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大陸から使者が来るのは、１００年以上ぶりですから。\nこれも星のお導きですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's been over a century since we last received envoys from the continent. Surely this is the stars' guidance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆、この喜ばしい出会いに感謝しましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, let us give thanks for this joyous encounter."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の導きに感謝を……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks be to the stars' guidance...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizens"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この国は信心深い人が多いんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The people here are very devout, aren't they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星に祈りを捧げるのは、この国でも同じなのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They pray to the stars here too, just like back home."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この国は、星に導かれた聖人様によって建国され、\n星の神の加護を受けた国ですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This nation was founded by a saint guided by the stars, and we remain under the Star God's protection."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（星に導かれた聖人……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A saint guided by the stars...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では皆さん、また後ほどお会いしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then everyone, I look forward to meeting you all again soon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]